    {
      "id": "engine-choices-3",
      "title": "The petrol, diesel and turbo engines (cont.)",
      "role": "proof",
      "topic": "powertrain",
      "outcome": "Choose an engine and offered gearbox",
      "usp_ids": [
        "choose-your-gears"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Opting for turbo petrol means an automatic gearbox and King trim; King also offers other engines. Keep the exact engine named on the written order while choosing the version's wheel finish.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_87bac17ee980151549ba",
            "focus": "Turbo petrol engine"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F005",
            "F006"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "engine-choices-L3",
          "start": 64.1,
          "duration": 16.3,
          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "For the 1.5-litre non-turbo petrol engine, the six-speed manual is listed on E, EX, EX(O), S(O), S(O) Knight, SX, SX Premium and King. Its IVT automatic, meaning intelligent variable transmission, is listed only on EX(O), S(O), SX Premium, King, King Knight and Lounge Edition; these are September compilation offerings, not a live stock check.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "none",
            "ref": "",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F009",
            "F065",
            "F066"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "engine-choices-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "For the 1.5-litre diesel, the six-speed manual is listed on E, EX, EX(O), S(O), S(O) Knight, SX Premium and King; the six-speed automatic is listed only on EX(O), S(O), King, King Knight and Lounge Edition. Stated maximum torque, an engine turning-force specification rather than a climb test, is 250 Nm, also given as 25.5 kgm, at 1,500–2,750 r/min.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "none",
            "ref": "",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F007",
            "F008",
            "F067",
            "F068"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "engine-choices-D2"
        },
        {
          "text": "The 1.5-litre turbo petrol is listed only on King with a seven-speed dual-clutch automatic. Its stated maximum power is 117.5 kW, also given as 160 PS, at 5,500 r/min; that is an engine specification, not a measured acceleration time.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_87bac17ee980151549ba",
            "focus": "Turbo engine specification"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
