      "outcome": "Choose wheels without assuming ride quality",
      "usp_ids": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "To choose matte black alloys, consider S(O) Knight, King Knight or Lounge Edition. The exterior finish is settled separately from how passengers and luggage share available cabin space.",
