          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "shared-space-L1",
          "start": 95.1,
          "duration": 16.8,
          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "The standard rear seat splits sixty-forty across all ten listed trims. Hyundai describes that arrangement as balancing passenger comfort and storage capacity, without supplying a boot volume in these facts.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_adb415f161dfc9567dde",
            "focus": "Split rear seatbacks"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F022",
            "F023"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "shared-space-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Rear passengers can adjust the seatback angle in two steps from S(O), including S(O) Knight, SX, SX Premium, King, King Knight and Lounge Edition. Reclining is a separate mechanism from folding the split seat.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "none",
            "ref": "",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F021",
            "F024",
            "F022"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "shared-space-D2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hyundai describes the boot as storage for luggage and travel essentials. I cannot confirm a litre-capacity figure from these details; a stated measurement needs an official specification, while personal luggage fit can be checked with the actual bags.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_086219c79f5c77a4f468",
            "focus": "Boot with luggage"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
