          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "airbags-and-help-L2",
          "start": 128.2,
          "duration": 16.3,
          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "Electronic stability control, four disc brakes, hill-start assistance, tyre-pressure monitoring and rear parking sensors are listed across the range. Hyundai describes hill-start assistance as preventing rollback on slopes; the driver remains responsible, and the equipment list does not establish a stopping distance or crash rating.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "none",
            "ref": "",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F026",
            "F027",
            "F028",
            "F029",
            "F030",
            "F062"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "airbags-and-help-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Surround-view and blind-spot-view camera monitors begin at SX Premium, continuing on King, King Knight and Lounge Edition. That camera availability is distinct from the selected-trim driver-assistance package.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_c8743c0adbf32f9b7e56",
            "focus": "Parking and side cameras"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F035",
            "F031"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "airbags-and-help-D2"
        },
        {
          "text": "King, King Knight and Lounge Edition have blind-spot collision warning and assistance, plus lane-keeping assistance. Smart Cruise Control with Stop and Go is automatic-only on those trims; none of this replaces safe, attentive driving.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "none",
            "ref": "",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F031",
            "F033",
